  Design: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0d59832f9c8b746f1b9a2891b5bcf3ea, type: 2}
  DesignerSolution: "T\u1ED5ng h\u1EE3p n\u1ED5i, c\u0103n c\u1ED5 n\u1ED1i, v\xF2ng
    v\u1EADt c\u1EA3n v\xE0 \u0111\u1ED5i m\u1EB7t \u0111\u1EE1; c\u1EA3 m\xE0n l\xE0
    th\u1EE7y ng\xE2n, kh\xF4ng chuy\u1EC3n m\xF4i tr\u01B0\u1EDDng. B\u1ED1 tr\xED:
    P14 + P07 + P11 + P15 \u2014 c\xE1c khoang ph\xEDa cao n\u1ED1i quanh m\u1ED9t
    ph\xF9 \u0111i\xEAu m\u1EB7t tr\u0103ng, m\u1ED9t bi.\nRecovery: S\xE2n tr\xEAn
    m\u1ED7i khoang gi\u1EEF ti\u1EBFn \u0111\u1ED9 c\u1EE5c b\u1ED9; \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
    n\u1ED5i sai ng\u1EAFn v\xE0 quay l\u1EA1i \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c; m\u1EB7t quan
    s\xE1t ph\u1EA3i th\u1EC3 hi\u1EC7n r\xF5 d\xF9 v\u1EADt li\u1EC7u b\u1EA1c"
